  "description": "After losing her professional golfing license due to a failed drug test, the innocent Im Soo-an is forced to find other work. However, the only person she can turn to is her first love - the very same man she coldly dumped in the past! Fortunately, he agrees to help her and manages to find her a job as a caddie, but it’s a far cry from being a professional golfer… To make matters worse, the men at the country club seem to think they can take advantage of her! She just has to deal with their advances until she clears her name, but how…?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
